WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.250
Build funnels. Own the data.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.375
Start from fifteen ready-made layouts.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.004
Drag a block onto the page, drop it in place, and your funnel takes shape.

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:16.129
Publish it, and start capturing leads on every screen.

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:24.015
Turn those leads into deals. Move one forward, and your forecast updates.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.665
Follow up automatically, and test every step before anything is sent.

00:00:30.967 --> 00:00:33.986
See what's converting, without third-party trackers.

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:39.250
Test new ideas with built-in A/B experiments.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.115
And take your code with you, anywhere.

00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:47.659
OpenFunnels. Open source, self-hosted, and yours to run.
